  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-10T13:16:25.305Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A friend list that is constantly changing avatars makes it so that many of them get unnecessarily forgotten. \nLike almost any online service, the purpose of an icon is to visually identify a person, to add another layer of recognition and I think the constantly changing world of VRChat desperately needs for players to add character to their profile, to make them easier to be visually recognized.\nI propose being able to add an icon to your profile, lessening the amount of times you join a friend and don't remember your previous experience with them because, like me, a lot of people tend to remember direct visual images easier rather than names.",
